  "method": "OpenStreetMap way 1167765305 (natural=grassland), traced verbatim, 116 vertices. Investigated as a candidate Main Injector infield proxy per the research brief, then rejected as a ring proxy: its bounding span (1038 m N-S x 860 m E-W, matching the integrator's earlier estimate) is roughly the right order of magnitude for a ~3.3 km-circumference oval, but its own perimeter (5548 m) is 67% longer than the Main Injector's sourced circumference (3319.4 m, src:fermilab-geo-mi-tdr-1994) -- it traces an irregular natural-grassland/wetland boundary, not a clean racetrack inset, and cannot be used to derive or validate the ring's shape.",
